ty"],["ARC or PLC in Erie County","/arc-plc/new-york/erie-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Erie County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids April to May came in under 90% of normal in 34 of them. In 2025, August to September on the middle of the grids came in at just 46% of normal. So far in 2026, March to April on the middle of the grids came in at 198% of normal. Grid 27206 had its driest year in 1960, at 70% of normal.</p>"}
